/**
 * The Ecdysis brand assets, from the brand kit of 3 October 2026 (Lucy
 * Griffiths; STYLE-GUIDE-LLM.txt v1.0): the layered orange dragonfly and the
 * lowercase serif wordmark, as the kit supplies them. The rule of the kit:
 * use the SVGs unchanged, never redraw or retype the logo, light lockup on
 * light surfaces and dark lockup on dark, the emblem's three fixed orange
 * tints identical in both. The dark lockup is the light one with the
 * wordmark in soft white, as the kit describes it ("same geometry").
 *
 * Served by the Worker under /brand/… as cacheable images; the shell shows
 * them with <picture>, so the browser picks light or dark by its own
 * colour-scheme preference and no script is needed.
 */

